{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_006_01_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:fcbdd55f454c8ae09e4be78b81d9abc62da371f3f1cf491c3023fc8f62c7f456",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_c:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e635de256bd73e8fc7c6676513a2ea2da8ec56361cc9ac4e9d9aae226c2203c",
      "text": "来，这是咖啡。\n牛奶和糖放在这里了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_c:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6f41289ab2f191968546529199c63155a79004293f4686dea40e6b7715d914b",
      "text": "谢谢。\n那我开动了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_c:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e2f50b4cbb91dce0f279370582fd2da471985b9bf91331b51bda8eac3b3a15a",
      "text": "嗯……这咖啡，非常美味呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32d84adb54ec76cd8b3d7b9eed4a35270f0f20e87120288abdc04e69c4aa7f39",
      "text": "合您的口味吗？太好了。\n这个我也非常中意呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_c:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5755cb86646aa2062f0842c7fff080218d3a099fb5521684b1829640320f2fe",
      "text": "之前喝过一次就念念不忘……\n就自己个人进口买回来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6323d7ddb9eb66c62c5ac0b6e168d845dbe327246a33695ddecc72e3fc4f1a0c",
      "text": "原来是这样啊。\n这么好喝的话，我也能理解这份心情了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_c:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03338f82f85b0790e9f8527679aeb3e5276d00babbee97297606032611d0f313",
      "text": "呵呵，谢谢夸奖。\n那么，我们进入碰头会正题吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_c:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26476a0bca0025b94246c251a8c210da69ad7e478b75d13bc758325fb2bdb598",
      "text": "好。翼先生接下来的工作是出演舞台剧，扮演\n翻译家这一点之前已经跟您说过了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_c:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70ccd6dee66a8a62a0b8e84d303c4ba1a3620c6680c2c856476ffb05bd3a6282",
      "text": "舞台监督那边追加了委托，\n希望我把剧中用到的英文句子翻译出来，对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_c:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06f99c85e477fcdddb4887394b863edbab31778909ac9f56a5f340f45af5b3c8",
      "text": "是的！对方希望能使用带着翼先生感性翻译出的台词。\n这是相关的剧本。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_c:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a640bfe7b09b6c420e942e75a5da1680cd429f0f4d76679ae3f9f3a52a620514",
      "text": "……原来如此，是悬疑剧啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
